      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i have this really annoying gnawing pain in my upper stomach area, like a constant ache. i've been taking omeprazole every morning for a few weeks for it but it's still there. i just got a really bad toothache though and i was wondering if it's okay to take some advil for the pain? i dont want to mess up my stomach more but i cant stand the tooth pain",
